---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---
<section class="band" aria-labelledby="privacy-h" style="background: rgb(var(--surface));">
  <div class="container-x grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16">
    <div class="lg:col-span-6">
      <h2 id="privacy-h" class="h-section">Your library stays on your device.</h2>
      <p class="lede mt-5">
        There is no account, no advertising and no analytics. Charts, setlists and notes are stored on the tablet.
      </p>
    </div>
    <ul class="rule-list lg:col-span-6 lg:mt-0 self-center">
      <li><strong>Microphone audio</strong> for chord detection is processed on the device and is never recorded or uploaded.</li>
      <li><strong>Importing</strong> from Planning Center or a web page needs an internet connection.</li>
      <li><strong>Backups</strong> are a file you export yourself. Chorder does not sync.</li>
      <li>Read the <a href={`${base}/privacy`} class="link">full privacy policy</a>.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
